# Validation artefacts are tracked: the block-Gibbs gold references anchor the
# Z-ratio surface accuracy claims and cost hours of compute to regenerate.
# ^dev$ in .Rbuildignore keeps them out of the tarball.
!dev/validation/
# The August 2026 pre-CRAN review record (briefs, reports, findings) is
# tracked so the review is versioned and visible to every clone.
!dev/review-2026-08/
# Generators for the material vignettes ship as .rds. A baked vignette number
# without its generator is a number with no provenance, so these are tracked;
# ^dev$ in .Rbuildignore keeps them out of the tarball.
!dev/vignette-data/
/paper/

# testthat problem artefacts
tests/testthat/_problems/
tests/testthat/testthat-problems.rds

# Local tooling
.claude/
renv/
